{"hw":"εἰσάγω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">εἰσάγω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">εἰσάγω</span> <span class=\"gk\">[α]</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐσάγεσκον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.196</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> -<span class=\"lex-itype gk\">αγήοχα</span> Epist. Philipp. ap. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.39</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐσῆγμαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.49</span> </span>:—<b class=\"lex-tr\">lead in</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">into,</b> esp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">into one's dwelling, introduce,</b> c. dupl.acc., <span class=\"gk\">αὐτοὺς εἰσῆγον θεῖον δόμον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.43</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">Κρήτην εἰσήγαγ' ἑταίρους</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">he led</b> his comrades <b class=\"lex-tr\">to</b> Crete, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.191</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς. τινὰ ἐς..</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.196</span> </span>, etc.: c. dat., <span class=\"gk\">τινὰ δόμοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1112</span> </span> codd.; <span class=\"gk\">εἰ. ψυχᾷ χάριν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <